integ5 0074 = patches/glue5/0069-glm-moe-router-select-group-sum.patch (overnight 2026-10-31), renumbered for the integrated stack on 3f94715d.

glm cuda: a decode window's router logits, select and expert grouping in one launch, the grouping without its
expert-by-pick scans (T3 candidate 4, glue5)

- tf_glm_topk_group_sum (glm_glue_moe.cuh) replaces tf_glm_slice_sum + tf_glm_topk_group on the grouped EXL3 decode
  path (rows <= 32):
  - every thread sums the router's 8 K slices of rows x ne logits in slice order (tf_glm_slice_sum's adds), writes
    the logits as before and keeps topk_row's sigmoid of each in shared memory;
  - a warp a row selects as topk_row does, on order-preserving integer keys of the choices with redux.sync max and
    min (two warp reductions a round instead of ten shuffles): fmaxf and == on choices are max and == on keys (a
    choice is never -0; NaN takes the lowest key, as fmaxf passes over NaN; a row whose every slot is NaN matches
    nothing, as before), so the same picks in the same order and the same weights;
  - group_rows_fast gives tf_exl3_group's uids, count and members (pick order, -1 tails, at most maxm) from shared
    atomic counts and each pick's place among its expert's earlier picks, instead of each expert scanning every
    pick: 13.8 us -> under 1 us of grouping at 8 rows.
- cuda_glue: routerSlices (router's slices alone; router = routerSlices + sliceSum, unchanged), selectGroupSum.
- cuda_moe.body: the grouped path takes routerSlices + selectGroupSum when the rows' scores fit 36 KiB of dynamic
  shared memory (GLM-5.3-Flash: 32 rows x 288 experts); otherwise the old router + selectGroup.
  TF_GLM_TOPK_SUM=0 (read once at load, local to the rank: no collectives) keeps the old path.
- Exact: logits, picks, weights, compact picks, count, ids and members byte for byte against the old chain at rows
  1-32 with ties, repeated rows, shared and duplicated experts, NaN / inf logits and NaN rows
  (opt/overnight/glue5/bench_topk.cu).

diff --git a/zig/kernels/cuda/glm_glue_moe.cuh b/zig/kernels/cuda/glm_glue_moe.cuh
index f333f6a9..52a5e3e8 100644
--- a/zig/kernels/cuda/glm_glue_moe.cuh
+++ b/zig/kernels/cuda/glm_glue_moe.cuh
@@ -122,6 +122,166 @@ extern "C" __global__ void __launch_bounds__(32)
